        "routing-doctor-hardening#frontmatter-rejects-non-utf8-command",
        "routing-doctor-hardening#doctor-reports-unreadable-command-as-unavailable",
        "routing-doctor-hardening#doctor-reports-crash-as-unavailable",
        "routing-doctor-hardening#doctor-survives-undecodable-output"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2",
      "title": "/clean-after-merged 文档注明 context: fork 命令未单独实测、step 1 注释措辞对齐；起点依据断言改为整句",
      "packet": "slices/S2.md",
